text.section:
The Commission may revoke a registration under this chapter upon any of the following grounds:

Any violation of the provisions of this chapter or regulations adopted thereunder or of any law or regulation applicable to the conduct of the registrant's business;


Charging fees for cashing items in excess of fees posted at any place of business or filed with the Commission pursuant to § 6.2-2105;


Conviction of a felony or misdemeanor involving fraud, misrepresentation, deceit, false swearing, or theft; or


Refusal to permit or respond to an investigation by the Commission.
